# Release Notes for fritzbox_smarthome

v2.1.0
* login via PBKDF2 challenge-response (Fritz!OS >= 7.24), MD5 fallback for older boxes;
  the method is selectable in the agent rule (automatic/PBKDF2/MD5), existing rules keep
  working and use "automatic"
* agent reports errors on stderr with a non-zero exit code instead of writing them into the section
* thermostats: no duplicate temperature/battery output anymore, target temperature "on"/"off"
  (raw 254/253) handled, comfort/eco temperature metrics, error code, fixed crash when the
  summeractive field is missing
* door/window contacts (Smart Control 350): contact state
* battery handling for non-thermostat devices cleaned up (metric "battery")
* metric names "WindowOpen"/"batteryLevel" renamed to "window_open"/"battery"
* removed the "show HANFUNUnit entries" option (never had an effect, units are not discovered)
* default for offline devices is WARN as documented
* README with setup instructions, defaults for port/protocol consistent (80/http)
* fixed whitespace being stripped from device and product names ("Thermostat Buero" became
  "ThermostatBuero"); service names change accordingly, run a service discovery after the update

v2.0.2
* fixed handling of login problems

v2.0.1
* added support for temperature readings from switches, batterystate
* draw graphs for battery and temperatures

v2.0.0
* initial release, rewrite of a version for CMK 1.6
* suppress HANFUNunit devices (they bring no information)
